# Local secrets — keep your real Gemini key out of git.
# (The .env file itself stays, since flutter_dotenv needs it to exist as a
# bundled asset — just don't commit a real key value in it. If you do use
# git, consider `git update-index --skip-worktree .env` after your first
# commit of the placeholder, so future edits to your real key never diff.)

